未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001","text":"玄謨性嚴剋少恩，而將軍宗越御下更苛酷，軍士謂之語曰：「寧作五年徒，不逢王玄謨。玄謨猶自可，宗越更殺我。」年八十一薨，諡曰莊公。子深早卒，深子繢嗣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":54,"last_line":54,"raw_start":5464,"raw_end":5598,"raw_character_offsets":[5464,5465,5466,5467,5468,5469,5470,5471,5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488,5489,5490,5491,5492,5493,5494,5495,5496,5497,5498,5499,5500,5501,5502,5503,5504,5505,5506,5507,5508,5509,5510,5511,5512,5513,5514,5515,5516,5517,5518,5519,5520,5521,5553,5554,5555,5556,5557,5558,5559,5560,5561,5562,5563,5564,5565,5566,5567],"revision_id":1997726},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"宗越","kind":"person","person_id":"2s7_zog_4me","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"王玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"宗越","kind":"person","person_id":"2s7_zog_4me","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"深","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-heirs:p001:m0068","start